      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}I&=PRT\\\\2000&=8000\\times0.05\\times T\\\\2000&=400T\\\\T&=\\frac{2000}{400}\\\\T&=5\\end{aligned}$$\nThe time is 5 years.",
